        <headline>Flood Warning issued September 25 at 11:57AM EDT until September 25 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Charleston WV</headline>
        <description>The Flood Warning will expire at noon EDT today for a portion of
southeast Ohio, including the following counties, Gallia and Vinton.

Flood waters have receded. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
